+    // `_expectedBridgeFr[f.chainId] == f.contractAddr`, which simultaneously
+    //   (i) restricts to the supported chain set — an unknown key returns the
+    //       default 0, which also rejects an empty-RLP `chainId == 0`; and
+    //   (ii) pins the exact bridge on that chain this deployment trusts.
