+    // unpopulated entry rejects every deposit for that chain). NOT threaded
+    // through the `onCodeUpgrade` migration cell — it must be re-populated by the
+    // owner after any code upgrade (the upgrade cell format is intentionally
+    // left unchanged to avoid coupling to the zerostate deploy tooling).
