The embedded blob had drifted two rotations behind the patch artefact we hand
to the partner, because the hex was maintained by hand. Rotate it to the
current fixture and point future rotations at the script that does it:

  sha256 9dacd998af5fd03af8097cb80a571df098c925bba235af61d920cc808360fae3
  acki-nacki-bridge/scripts/embed_deposit_vk_blob.py <this file>

Shape, PI layout and blob size are unchanged (12 PI, 5006 B, advice [17,13]),
so finalizeDeposit needs no other change. Verified: all 10 committed proofs are
ACCEPTED through ZKHALO2VERIFYWITHVK against this blob.

